#, fuzzy
msgid "If set to true, the CTE queries are inlined by default. Valid values for this property are `true`, `false` or `auto`. Default is `true` which will always inline non-recursive CTEs. The `auto` configuration will only make use of inlining if the JPA provider and DBMS dialect support/require it. The property can be changed for a criteria builder before constructing a query."
msgstr "如果设置为 true，CTE 查询将默认进行内联。该属性的有效值为 `true` 、 `false` 或 `auto` 。默认值为 `true` ，这将始终对非递归 CTE 进行内联。 `auto` 配置仅在 JPA 提供商和 DBMS 方言支持或要求内联时才会使用内联。 在构建查询之前，可以针对条件构建器更改此属性。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Apart from these configuration options, further configuration and customization can be applied by observing a `CriteriaBuilderConfiguration` or `EntityViewConfiguration` events and applying customizations on these objects. The various customization use cases can be found in the link:https://persistence.blazebit.com/documentation/entity-view/manual/en_US/index.html#quarkus-customization[Quarkus section of the entity-view documentation]."
msgstr "除了这些配置选项外，还可以通过监听 `CriteriaBuilderConfiguration` 或 `EntityViewConfiguration` 事件，并对这些对象进行自定义设置，从而实现进一步的配置和定制。各种自定义用例可在 link:https://persistence.blazebit.com/documentation/entity-view/manual/en_US/index.html#quarkus-customization[entity-view 文档的 Quarkus 部分] 中找到。"

